# Source car assets (multi-GB): keep only the runtime GLB + build inputs.
# The optimized aston_db4.glb, its small tex/ maps and build_glb.py stay
# tracked; raw scans, archives and unpacked PBR sheets are regenerable.
cars/*.obj
cars/*.7z
cars/*.zip
cars/*.rar
cars/aston_db4_raw.glb
cars/textures_pbr/

